<title>USA: Remington Products names president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Remington Products names president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEPORT, Conn. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Remington Products Co LLC said Wednesday it had named Neil DeFeo president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective immediately. DeFeo succeeds Peter Cuneo, who resigned to &quot;pursue other business interests,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Most recently, DeFeo was group vice president for U.S. operations at Clorox Co.</p>
<p>Remington manufactures and markets electrical personal-care appliances.</p>
